    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d660">

                <pb facs="0631" n="1365" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1365"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 702.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose the copy of a
                    note from Tevfik Pasha, minister of foreign affairs, dated the 3d instant. I do
                    not at present deem it expedient to notice the praise bestowed on the conduct of
                    the <pb facs="0632" n="1366" xml:id="pg1366"/> Imperial troops during the
                    massacres at Harpoot by the note of his excellency. Information deemed reliable
                    shows that they made no effort to protect American property from incendiary
                    burning, and joined in the pillage.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d660-a1.xml" xpointer="d660-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
